00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Tracy and I have
a lot of history together.

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
Most people think that we me
on "Saturday Night Live,"

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:05.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
but we go back
further than that.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:07.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tracy and I
actually were together

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:10.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
at the same cooking networ
back in the early '90s.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ] Yeah.
-Yeah, it was called EatsTV.

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:14.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What were we doing?
-I know, man.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
Between shows,
we would do these segments

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
where we gave the audience
cooking tips,

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
but to keep
our line readings fresh,

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
our director
wouldn't let us see the line

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.424 line:92%
until while we were shooting

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:28.161
So, we were reading them for the
first time right there on set.

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I found
some of our old footage.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What?
-I swear.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, for the first time
in decades,

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.269 line:92%
here is Tracy and I on EatsTV.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:37.103 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:40.473 size:88% position:44%
-You're watching EatsTV,
your home for recipes,

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
restaurants,
and really good food.

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:46.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
Stay tuned for tips
from the EatsTV kitchen.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.347 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
